-- Cataclysm-HWRM: the Kuun-Lan's guns (Cataclysm smothership.shp GUN 1-6: GUN_HiddenGimble, GUNSIZE_LARGE,
-- WEAPON_PROJECTILE, DamageMult 1.1, FireTime 0.25, BulletSpeed / BulletRange 6000 x 0.35, MaxAngle 85: the setAngles cone);
-- damage 40 (large projectile vs armour 0, table 0x72b228) x 1.1. Bullet look, accuracy and the rest: Cataclysm
-- Remastered's Bst_MSTurret (user: Cataclysm's weapon setup, not theirs).
-- No line-of-fire check (as stock HW1 HW1_MothershipGun; Cataclysm hidden gimbals have none): with it the rear guns
-- held fire behind their own hull (user). Each gun picks its own target (shoot at secondaries / surroundings: 1, 1),
-- HWRM's form of the Kuun-Lan's canTargetMultipleTargets.
